---
title: "Where should prompt wiki-link candidates come from?"
accTitle: "Wiki-link completion architecture"
accDescr: "The recommended kit ranks Obsidian metadataCache locally. Spawning capture-complete and using AbstractInputSuggest as chrome are rejected."
config:
  flowchart:
    rankSpacing: 14
    nodeSpacing: 16
    wrappingWidth: 260
---
flowchart TD
  FIELD["`**Host input**<br/>Intention, work log`"]
  ATTACH["`**wikiLink.attach**<br/>Detects [[ at caret`"]
  CACHE["`**metadataCache**<br/>Notes, aliases, headings`"]
  RANK["`**MatchKind ranker**<br/>Shared with capture-complete`"]
  CARD["`**Bob popover**<br/>Note Heading Block rows`"]
  BOB["`**bob capture-complete**<br/>300 ms disk index`"]
  AIS["`**AbstractInputSuggest**<br/>Whole-field core chrome`"]
  FIELD ==> ATTACH
  ATTACH ==> CACHE
  CACHE ==> RANK
  RANK ==> CARD
  ATTACH -.->|rejected| BOB
  ATTACH -.->|rejected| AIS
  classDef focus fill:#E8F1FB,stroke:#3B78C2,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#0F2E52
  classDef outcome fill:#E7F5EC,stroke:#2E7D4F,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#123D24
  classDef risk fill:#FDECEC,stroke:#C0392B,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#5F1414
  classDef proposed stroke-dasharray:5 3
  class FIELD,ATTACH focus
  class CACHE,RANK,CARD outcome
  class BOB,AIS risk
  class BOB proposed
  class AIS proposed
